```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Activate Your Elearning Account</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #f4f7fb;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: #1f2937;
        }

        table {
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        img {
            border: 0;
            display: block;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .email-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 15px;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        /* =========================
           HEADER
        ========================== */

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed);
            padding: 32px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 27px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.7px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: #c4b5fd;
        }

        .security-icon {
            width: 62px;
            height: 62px;
            margin: 0 auto 18px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 62px;
            font-size: 29px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 25px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .header p {
            margin: 10px 0 0;
            color: #e0e7ff;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* =========================
           CONTENT
        ========================== */

        .content {
            padding: 35px 30px;
        }

        .greeting {
            margin: 0 0 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .greeting strong {
            color: #111827;
        }

        .intro {
            margin: 0 0 28px;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        /* =========================
           ACTIVATION CARD
        ========================== */

        .activation-card {
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .activation-card-header {
            padding: 16px 20px;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .activation-label {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background-color: #ede9fe;
            color: #6d28d9;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.6px;
        }

        .activation-card-body {
            padding: 28px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .code-label {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #9ca3af;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.6px;
        }

        .activation-code {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
            border: 1px dashed #c7d2fe;
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: #4f46e5;
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            line-height: 1;
            font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
        }

        .expiry-text {
            margin: 18px 0 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #6b7280;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .expiry-text strong {
            color: #ef4444;
        }

        /* =========================
           SECURITY NOTICE
        ========================== */

        .security-notice {
            margin-top: 28px;
            padding: 17px 18px;
            background-color: #fffbeb;
            border: 1px solid #fde68a;
            border-radius: 9px;
        }

        .security-notice-title {
            margin: 0 0 7px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #92400e;
        }

        .security-notice p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #92400e;
        }

        /* =========================
           CTA
        ========================== */

        .cta-wrapper {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0 15px;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            background-color: #4f46e5;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .cta-description {
            margin: 12px 0 0;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }

        /* =========================
           COMMUNITY MESSAGE
        ========================== */

        .welcome-message {
            margin-top: 28px;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .welcome-message h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #111827;
        }

        .welcome-message p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        /* =========================
           FOOTER
        ========================== */

        .footer {
            padding: 25px 30px;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 5px 0;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }

        .footer strong {
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #6d28d9;
        }

        .copyright {
            margin-top: 15px !important;
        }

        /* =========================
           MOBILE
        ========================== */

        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {

            .email-wrapper {
                padding: 15px 8px;
            }

            .header {
                padding: 28px 20px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 22px;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 25px 18px;
            }

            .activation-card-body {
                padding: 24px 15px;
            }

            .activation-code {
                font-size: 24px;
                letter-spacing: 5px;
                padding: 14px 18px;
            }

            .footer {
                padding: 22px 18px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="email-wrapper">

        <div class="email-container">

            <!-- =========================
                 HEADER
            ========================== -->

            <div class="header">

                <div class="logo">
                    Elearning<span>.</span>
                </div>

                <div class="security-icon">
                    🔐
                </div>

                <h1>Welcome to Elearning!</h1>

                <p>
                    One final step to activate your account.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- =========================
                 MAIN CONTENT
            ========================== -->

            <div class="content">

                <p class="greeting">
                    Hello <strong><%= user.name %></strong>,
                </p>

                <p class="intro">
                    Thanks for joining <strong>Elearning</strong>.
                    We're excited to have you with us. To complete your
                    registration and start your learning journey, please
                    verify your email address using the activation code below.
                </p>


                <!-- Activation Code -->

                <div class="activation-card">

                    <div class="activation-card-header">

                        <span class="activation-label">
                            Email Verification
                        </span>

                    </div>

                    <div class="activation-card-body">

                        <p class="code-label">
                            Your activation code
                        </p>

                        <div class="activation-code">
                            <%= activationCode %>
                        </div>

                        <p class="expiry-text">
                            This code will expire in
                            <strong>5 minutes</strong>.
                            Please complete verification before it expires.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- CTA -->

                <div class="cta-wrapper">

                    <a href="#" class="cta-button">
                        Activate My Account
                    </a>

                    <p class="cta-description">
                        Enter the verification code on the Elearning
                        activation page.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <!-- Security Notice -->

                <div class="security-notice">

                    <p class="security-notice-title">
                        🔒 Security Notice
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        If you did not create an Elearning account,
                        you can safely ignore this email. Never share
                        your activation code with anyone.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <!-- Welcome -->

                <div class="welcome-message">

                    <h3>
                        Your learning journey starts here 🚀
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Once your account is activated, you'll be ready
                        to explore courses, learn new skills, and continue
                        growing with our community.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- =========================
                 FOOTER
            ========================== -->

            <div class="footer">

                <p>
                    Need help? Contact our support team at
                </p>

                <p>
                    <a href="mailto:hassanshahid5218@gmail.com">
                        hassanshahid5218@gmail.com
                    </a>
                </p>

                <p>
                    You're receiving this email because an account
                    was created using this email address.
                </p>

                <p class="copyright">
                    © 2026 <strong>Elearning</strong>. All rights reserved.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</body>

</html>
```
